#: templates/dg_wiki/_comments.html:19
msgid "Watchers hear about new comments. Mention someone with @ to tell them."
msgstr ""
"Volgers horen van nieuwe reacties. Noem iemand met @ om die persoon in te "
"lichten."

#: templates/dg_wiki/_comments.html:28 templates/dg_wiki/_comments.html:33
